The band is ready, folks. All they need now is the song.

3
00:00:16,612 --> 00:00:18,412
Out of order?!

4
00:00:18,921 --> 00:00:23,292
Word is, the elevator's out. Somebody's taking the stairs!

5
00:00:24,924 --> 00:00:27,118
Thirty seconds to midnight!

6
00:00:33,435 --> 00:00:35,235
Special delivery!

7
00:00:48,574 --> 00:00:52,327
Right on time. Happy New Year, from the Starlight Hotel.
